.SS "int IComparable< \fBOptional\fP< T > >\&. SystemEx\&.Optional< T >\&.CompareTo (\fBOptional\fP< T > other)"

.PP
Compares this optional instance with another optional instance using the CompareTo(Optional<T>) method and returns a standard integer comparison result compatible with IComparable<T>\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIother\fP The optional instance to compare against\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
\fR-1\fP if this instance is considered less than \fIother\fP , \fR0\fP if both instances are equal, or \fR1\fP if this instance is greater\&. 
.RE
.PP

.PP
This method simply forwards to CompareTo(Optional<T>) and casts the resulting \fBCompareResult\fP to an integer, making the optional type compatible with standard \&.NET sorting and comparison mechanisms\&. 
.PP
